BSP-Yocto-Ampliphy-i.MX6-PD21.1.1       2022-02-24
==================================================
- Linux Kernel v5.10.48-phy3 (LTS kernel)
- barebox v2021.04.0-phy6
- Yocto 3.3.5 (hardknott)
- Qt 5.15.2 from meta-qt5 (hardknott)

