Build Environment:
------------------
- Ubuntu 20.04 64Bit

Features:
---------
- Added support for ADINPHY on phyCORE
- Added new distro and image:
  For systems using Security or RAUC, a distro got introduced named "ampliphy-provisioning" with
  the image "phytec-provisioning-image". The distro and image is configured for installing a image with
  RAUC and Security support from sd-card to emmc and for configuration of Security features on the board.
